        "## Load and Preprocess Data\n",
        "\n",
        "Now, let's load the image datasets from the specified directories. We will use `image_dataset_from_directory` to automatically infer class labels from the directory structure. We'll also define image dimensions and batch size, and apply necessary preprocessing like resizing and rescaling for the EfficientNet model."
